    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> <strong>Bolster Undead</strong> (Bonus Action, once per Long Rest): your Undead within 60 ft gain temp HP equal to your Wizard level (module). <strong>Extinguish Undead:</strong> when one of your Undead drops to 0 HP, the module offers to make it explode - creatures within 10 ft make a DEX save, Necrotic damage of d6s equal to half its Hit Dice (rounded up), half on a success, and a failure blocks Reactions until its next turn.</p>",
